  "description": "All five notice states at once alongside one action_id carrying two different action_types, so every notice section and the integrity section render together.",
  "why_it_exists": "Conflict notices written by the WF5 conflict detector could be silently lost: a notice whose Telegram delivery failed or was abandoned never resurfaced anywhere the owner reads. The digest gained three notice sections plus an unreported-count headline, and this fixture set pins the status lifecycle (blank/PENDING/FAILED/EXHAUSTED/SENT) so a reported notice stays silent and an unreported one never does.",
